WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is very exciting.
Just announced that you're one

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:04.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the moderators for thes
two debates that are coming up

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:04.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
We knew the debates
were coming up.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.840
We didn't know the moderators.
But we do know that it's going

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be two nights,
ten candidates each night.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Doubleheader.
-Doubleheader.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:14.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
-With ten teams playing
each other on both nights.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
