I would imagine, you know,

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:19.719 size:88% position:44%
campaign moderating prep
is hard to begin with,

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.721
but you -- This isn't like
you have to do a book report

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is like you have to d
a book report on all the books

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The funny thing is, like,
we start getting in

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
