00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:16.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because that's like
random lottery draw?

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:18.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, the DNC --
Thank God, not us.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:24.250
It is the DNC who decides,
of the Democratic candidates

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
which 20 make the cut.
-Yeah.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:27.554 line:92%
So three as of now, three --

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
We don't know
