00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.302 line:92%
-Yes. Do a third night. Exactly.

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:45.105
But then, once they've got the
20, then they have to decide

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:47.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
