00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.013 line:92%
The DNC will do it, and I thin

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:56.015
that will be some sort of
random draw or something.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
But whatever happens, all hell
is going to break loose.

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.955
-You mentioned breakout moments,
and I want to ask about that

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it seems --
It strikes me,

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.925 size:84% position:42%
based on the way you do
your show, you are --

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
