00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:18.638 line:92%
Is there any way around that

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:21.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
-To warn them right now
that they shouldn't do that?

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:24.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, that's the thing.
Any time somebody has rehearse

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.380
