throw up some word soup."

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:11.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"See? It sticks.
I told you it would stick.

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:13.960 size:78% position:39%
No puppet, no puppet.
You're the puppet."

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.263
Yes. I mean, the candidate
right now are in the stage

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:20.633
of the Democratic primary
where they're not, like,

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:21.534 line:92%
being mean to each other.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:22.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're not taking
each other down.

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:24.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think lots of people
who want Donald Trump

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.907
to lose the general election
hope that the Democratic primary

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:29.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
stays like that forever.
-Right.

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
