with all the other people

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:51.357 size:78% position:39%
who might conceivably
be president, too.

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:52.525 line:92%
So, I mean, what is the lesson

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:54.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
of Hillary Clinton
versus Donald Trump

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:56.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
in terms of how to beat hi
in a general election?

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:58.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't think
anybody has any idea.

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:00.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think it's got to be
something new.

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:02.669
-The other thing that's going to
be fascinating to watch is

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:04.337 size:81% position:41% line:92%
based on how voters --

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:07.006
the feedback the first night o
those ten people debating --

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:09.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
the feedback from that night
how it affects the way

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:11.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
that people will debate
the next night.

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:13.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
If everybody says,
"Oh, it was a little boring,

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:14.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause everybody
was so friendly,"

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:17.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
you might have the knives ou
right away on night two.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:18.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which would be fascinating
to watch

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:20.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
and what makes this year
so interesting

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:21.888 line:92%
because there's so many people

00:05:21.888 --> 00:05:23.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, I mean,
the other idea, too, is just -

00:05:23.256 --> 00:05:26.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, it's two hours for eac
of those two nights.

00:05:26.326 --> 00:05:28.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's ten candidates
on the stage

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:30.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
for those entire two hours
plus there has to be some time

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, for the questions
