00:05:32.899 --> 00:05:35.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, how many minutes
are each of them going to get?

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:39.605
And for somebody like, you know,
Joe Biden or Bernie Sanders,

00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:41.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
who's doing really well
in the polls,

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
